 500 to 1500mm per side, its versatile installation options\\u2014suspended or freestanding\\u2014make it an innovative solution to captivate audiences with vivid visuals and dynamic content on all faces.\", \"sku\": \"BL-CUS-CUBE3\", \"brand\": {\"@type\": \"Brand\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\"}, \"manufacturer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"logo\": \"https://files.ihgbrands.com/uploads_hero_banner.webp\"}, \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products/cube-led-display-p3\", \"category\": \"custom-shapes\", \"image\": \"https://files.ihgbrands.com/brightluxx/site-images/prod_cube-led-display-p3.webp\", \"offers\": {\"@type\": \"AggregateOffer\", \"priceCurrency\": \"USD\", \"lowPrice\": 2000, \"highPrice\": 15000, \"offerCount\": 1, \"availability\": \"https://schema.org/InStock\", \"seller\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"logo\": \"https://files.ihgbrands.com/uploads_hero_banner.webp\"}, \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products/cube-led-display-p3\"}, \"additionalProperty\": [{\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Pixel Pitch\", \"value\": \"3mm\"}, {\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Brightness\", \"value\": \"1,500 nits\"}, {\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Warranty\", \"value\": \"3 Years Standard | 5 Years Extended Available\"}]}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What are the key technical specifications of the Cube LED Display P3?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The Cube LED Display P3 features a 3mm pixel pitch, 1,500 nits brightness, and a six-sided cube shape with sizes ranging from 500mm to 1500mm per side, providing crisp and vibrant visuals on all faces.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Can the Cube LED Display P3 be installed both hanging and freestanding?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Yes, this LED cube is designed for versatile installation, allowing it to be either suspended from ceilings or used as a freestanding display, adapting perfectly to various event or retail environments.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How is content managed and programmed across the six faces of the cube?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The Cube LED Display P3 is fully programmable on all six sides, enabling synchronized or independent content display with flexible control software for dynamic and engaging visual presentations.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What warranty does Brightluxx offer for the Cube LED Display P3?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Brightluxx provides a standard warranty covering manufacturing defects and performance for 2 years, with options for extended support plans to ensure long-term reliability.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How does the Cube LED Display P3 compare with traditional flat LED panels?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Unlike flat panels, the Cube LED Display P3 delivers a unique 3D viewing experience with content on all six faces, making it a standout centerpiece that captures attention from multiple angles in exhibitions and retail spaces.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What types of environments and events is the Cube LED Display P3 best suited for?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"This cube is ideal for exhibitions, retail stores, trade shows, and events where high visibility and innovative digital signage can boost engagement and brand exposure.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What factors affect the pricing of the Cube LED Display P3?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Pricing depends on the cube size selected (500mm to 1500mm per side), customization requirements, installation complexity, and additional software or support services that may be included.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Is the Cube LED Display P3 suitable for outdoor use?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The Cube LED Display P3 is primarily designed for indoor environments like retail and exhibitions. For outdoor applications, please consult with Brightluxx for suitable weatherproof alternatives.\"}}]}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"Home\", \"item\": \"https://brightluxx.com\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"Products\", \"item\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 3, \"name\": \"Cube LED Display P3\", \"item\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products/cube-led-display-p3\"}]}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"Organization\", \"@id\": \"https://brightluxx.com/#organization\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\", \"legalName\": \"Brightluxx LED Displays\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"logo\": \"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\", \"telephone\": \"+971559954274\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"streetAddress\": \"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\", \"addressLocality\": \"Dubai\", \"addressCountry\": \"AE\"}, \"contactPoint\": {\"@type\": \"ContactPoint\", \"telephone\": \"+971559954274\", \"contactType\": \"sales\", \"areaServed\": [\"AE\", \"SA\", \"QA\", \"KW\", \"BH\", \"OM\"], \"availableLanguage\": [\"en\", \"ar\"]}}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"LocalBusiness\", \"@id\": \"https://brightluxx.com/#localbusiness\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx LED Displays\", \"image\": \"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"telephone\": \"+971559954274\", \"priceRange\": \"AED 2,500 - AED 12,000 per m\\u00b2\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"streetAddress\": \"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\", \"addressLocality\": \"Dubai\", \"addressCountry\": \"AE\"}, \"geo\": {\"@type\": \"GeoCoordinates\", \"latitude\": 24.9857, \"longitude\": 55.0272}, \"openingHoursSpecification\": {\"@type\": \"OpeningHoursSpecification\", \"dayOfWeek\": [\"Monday\", \"Tuesday\", \"Wednesday\", \"Thursday\", \"Friday\", \"Saturday\"], \"opens\": \"09:00\", \"closes\": \"18:00\"}, \"areaServed\": [\"Dubai\", \"Abu Dhabi\", \"United Arab Emirates\", \"Saudi Arabia\", \"Qatar\", \"Kuwait\", \"Bahrain\", \"Oman\"]}</script><div><h1>Cube LED Display P3</h1><p>Shop Cube LED Display P3 in Dubai for dynamic 3D advertising. Brightluxx offers top LED products across UAE. Buy now!</p><p><strong>6-sided LED cube. Eye-catching centerpiece for exhibitions and retail.</strong></p><p>The Cube LED Display P3 is a six-sided, fully programmable LED display with a 3mm pixel pitch and 1,500 nits brightness, designed as a striking centerpiece for exhibitions, retail stores, and events. Available in sizes from 500 to 1500mm per side, its versatile installation options—suspended or freestanding—make it an innovative solution to captivate audiences with vivid visuals and dynamic content on all faces.</p><h2>FAQ</h2><h3>What are the key technical specifications of the Cube LED Display P3?</h3><p>The Cube LED Display P3 features a 3mm pixel pitch, 1,500 nits brightness, and a six-sided cube shape with sizes ranging from 500mm to 1500mm per side, providing crisp and vibrant visuals on all faces.</p><h3>Can the Cube LED Display P3 be installed both hanging and freestanding?</h3><p>Yes, this LED cube is designed for versatile installation, allowing it to be either suspended from ceilings or used as a freestanding display, adapting perfectly to various event or retail environments.</p><h3>How is content managed and programmed across the six faces of the cube?</h3><p>The Cube LED Display P3 is fully programmable on all six sides, enabling synchronized or independent content display with flexible control software for dynamic and engaging visual presentations.</p><h3>What warranty does Brightluxx offer for the Cube LED Display P3?</h3><p>Brightluxx provides a standard warranty covering manufacturing defects and performance for 2 years, with options for extended support plans to ensure long-term reliability.</p></div></main><!--$--><!--/$--><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/310vm2bl3xxpt.js\" id=\"_R_\" async=\"\"></script><script>(self.__next_f=self.__next_f||[]).push([0])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"1:\\\"$Sreact.fragment\\\"\\n2:I[31262,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\\\"],\\\"PageViewTracker\\\"]\\n3:I[39756,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n4:I[37457,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n6:I[97367,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\\\"],\\\"OutletBoundary\\\"]\\n7:\\\"$Sreact.suspense\\\"\\na:I[97367,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\\\"],\\\"ViewportBoundary\\\"]\\nc:I[97367,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\\\"],\\\"MetadataBoundary\\\"]\\ne:I[68027,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\",1]\\n:HL[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/2xf3yuf2jb148.css\\\",\\\"style\\\"]\\n9:X\\n0:{\\\"P\\\":null,\\\"c\\\":[\\\"\\\",\\\"products\\\",\\\"cube-led-display-p3\\\"],\\\"q\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"i\\\":false,\\\"f\\\":[[[\\\"\\\",{\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"slug\\\",\\\"products/cube-led-display-p3\\\",\\\"c\\\",[\\\"products\\\"]],{\\\"children\\\":[\\\"__PAGE__\\\",{},\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"$undefined\\\",4608]},\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"$undefined\\\",4608]},\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"$undefined\\\",4624],[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$1\\\",\\\"c\\\",{\\\"children\\\":[[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"link\\\",\\\"0\\\",{\\\"rel\\\":\\\"stylesheet\\\",\\\"href\\\":\\\"/_next/static/chunks/2xf3yuf2jb148.css\\\",\\