ightluxx/site-images/prod_cube-led-display-p3.webp\", \"offers\": {\"@type\": \"AggregateOffer\", \"priceCurrency\": \"USD\", \"lowPrice\": 2000, \"highPrice\": 15000, \"offerCount\": 1, \"availability\": \"https://schema.org/InStock\", \"seller\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"logo\": \"https://files.ihgbrands.com/uploads_hero_banner.webp\"}, \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products/cube-led-display-p3\"}, \"additionalProperty\": [{\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Pixel Pitch\", \"value\": \"3mm\"}, {\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Brightness\", \"value\": \"1,500 nits\"}, {\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Warranty\", \"value\": \"3 Years Standard | 5 Years Extended Available\"}]}10:Tb1d,{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What are the key technical specifications of the Cube LED Display P3?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The Cube LED Display P3 features a 3mm pixel pitch, 1,500 nits brightness, and a six-sided cube shape with sizes ranging from 500mm to 1500mm per side, providing crisp and vibrant visuals on all faces.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Can the Cube LED Display P3 be installed both hanging and freestanding?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Yes, this LED cube is designed for versatile installation, allowing it to be either suspended from ceilings or used as a freestanding display, adapting perfectly to various event or retail environments.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How is content managed and programmed across the six faces of the cube?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The Cube LED Display P3 is fully programmable on all six sides, enabling synchronized or independent content display with flexible control software for dynamic and engaging visual presentations.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What warranty does Brightluxx offer for the Cube LED Display P3?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Brightluxx provides a standard warranty covering manufacturing defects and performance for 2 years, with options for extended support plans to ensure long-term reliability.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How does the Cube LED Display P3 compare with traditional flat LED panels?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Unlike flat panels, the Cube LED Display P3 delivers a unique 3D viewing experience with content on all six faces, making it a standout centerpiece that captures attention from multiple angles in exhibitions and retail spaces.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What types of environments and events is the Cube LED Display P3 best suited for?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"This cube is ideal for exhibitions, retail stores, trade shows, and events where high visibility and innovative digital signage can boost engagement and brand exposure.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What factors affect the pricing of the Cube LED Display P3?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Pricing depends on the cube size selected (500mm to 1500mm per side), customization requirements, installation complexity, and additional software or support services that may be included.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Is the Cube LED Display P3 suitable for outdoor use?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The Cube LED Display P3 is primarily designed for indoor environments like retail and exhibitions. For outdoor applications, please consult with Brightluxx for suitable weatherproof alternatives.\"}}]}5:[\"$\",\"main\",null,{\"data-testid\":\"next-server-rendered-parity-page\",\"children\":[[[\"$\",\"script\",\"0\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$f\"}}],[\"$\",\