/brightluxx.com/#localbusiness\\\", \\\"name\\\": \\\"Brightluxx LED Displays\\\", \\\"image\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\\\", \\\"url\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com\\\", \\\"telephone\\\": \\\"+971559954274\\\", \\\"priceRange\\\": \\\"AED 2,500 - AED 12,000 per m\\\\u00b2\\\", \\\"address\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"PostalAddress\\\", \\\"streetAddress\\\": \\\"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\\\", \\\"addressLocality\\\": \\\"Dubai\\\", \\\"addressCountry\\\": \\\"AE\\\"}, \\\"geo\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"GeoCoordinates\\\", \\\"latitude\\\": 24.9857, \\\"longitude\\\": 55.0272}, \\\"openingHoursSpecification\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"OpeningHoursSpecification\\\", \\\"dayOfWeek\\\": [\\\"Monday\\\", \\\"Tuesday\\\", \\\"Wednesday\\\", \\\"Thursday\\\", \\\"Friday\\\", \\\"Saturday\\\"], \\\"opens\\\": \\\"09:00\\\", \\\"closes\\\": \\\"18:00\\\"}, \\\"areaServed\\\": [\\\"Dubai\\\", \\\"Abu Dhabi\\\", \\\"United Arab Emirates\\\", \\\"Saudi Arabia\\\", \\\"Qatar\\\", \\\"Kuwait\\\", \\\"Bahrain\\\", \\\"Oman\\\"]}\"}}]\n15:T700,<h1>Cube LED Display P3</h1><p>Shop Cube LED Display P3 in Dubai for dynamic 3D advertising. Brightluxx offers top LED products across UAE. Buy now!</p><p><strong>6-sided LED cube. Eye-catching centerpiece for exhibitions and retail.</strong></p><p>The Cube LED Display P3 is a six-sided, fully programmable LED display with a 3mm pixel pitch and 1,500 nits brightness, designed as a striking centerpiece for exhibitions, retail stores, and events. Available in sizes from 500 to 1500mm per side, its versatile installation options—suspended or freestanding—make it an innovative solution to captivate audiences with vivid visuals and dynamic content on all faces.</p><h2>FAQ</h2><h3>What are the key technical specifications of the Cube LED Display P3?</h3><p>The Cube LED Display P3 features a 3mm pixel pitch, 1,500 nits brightness, and a six-sided cube shape with sizes ranging from 500mm to 1500mm per side, providing crisp and vibrant visuals on all faces.</p><h3>Can the Cube LED Display P3 be installed both hanging and freestanding?</h3><p>Yes, this LED cube is designed for versatile installation, allowing it to be either suspended from ceilings or used as a freestanding display, adapting perfectly to various event or retail environments.</p><h3>How is content managed and programmed across the six faces of the cube?</h3><p>The Cube LED Display P3 is fully programmable on all six sides, enabling synchronized or independent content display with flexible control software for dynamic and engaging visual presentations.</p><h3>What warranty does Brightluxx offer for the Cube LED Display P3?</h3><p>Brightluxx provides a standard warranty covering manufacturing defects and performance for 2 years, with options for extended support plans to ensure long-term reliability.</p>14:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$15\"}}]\nb:[[\"$\",\"meta\",\"0\",{\"charSet\":\"utf-8\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"viewport\",\"content\":\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"}]]\n8:null\nd:[[\"$\",\"title\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"Cube LED Display P3 - Dynamic 3D LED Solution Dubai | Brightluxx\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"description\",\"content\":\"Shop Cube LED Display P3 in Dubai for dynamic 3D advertising. Brightluxx offers top LED products across UAE. Buy now!\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"2\",{\"rel\":\"canonical\",\"href\":\"https://brightluxx.com/products/cube-led-display-p3\"}]]\n","segmentData":{"/_tree":":HL[\"/_next/static/chunks/2xf3yuf2jb148.css\",\"style\"]\n0:{\"tree\":{\"name\":\"\",\"param\":null,\"prefetchHints\":4176,\"slots\":{\"children\":{\"name\":\"slug\",\"param\":{\"type\":\"c\",\"key\":\"products/cube-led-display-p3\",\"siblings\":[\"products\"]},\"prefetchHints\":4192,\"slots\":{\"children\":{\"name\":\"__PAGE__\",\"param\":null,\"prefetchHints\":4256,\"slots\":null}}}}},\"staleTime\":300,\"buildId\":\"0VevTopRFbkV79u5_PhIJ\"}\n","/_full":"1:\"$Sreac