suals and dynamic content on all faces.</p><h2>FAQ</h2><h3>What are the key technical specifications of the Cube LED Display P3?</h3><p>The Cube LED Display P3 features a 3mm pixel pitch, 1,500 nits brightness, and a six-sided cube shape with sizes ranging from 500mm to 1500mm per side, providing crisp and vibrant visuals on all faces.</p><h3>Can the Cube LED Display P3 be installed both hanging and freestanding?</h3><p>Yes, this LED cube is designed for versatile installation, allowing it to be either suspended from ceilings or used as a freestanding display, adapting perfectly to various event or retail environments.</p><h3>How is content managed and programmed across the six faces of the cube?</h3><p>The Cube LED Display P3 is fully programmable on all six sides, enabling synchronized or independent content display with flexible control software for dynamic and engaging visual presentations.</p><h3>What warranty does Brightluxx offer for the Cube LED Display P3?</h3><p>Brightluxx provides a standard warranty covering manufacturing defects and performance for 2 years, with options for extended support plans to ensure long-term reliability.</p>14:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$15\"}}]\nb:[[\"$\",\"meta\",\"0\",{\"charSet\":\"utf-8\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"viewport\",\"content\":\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"}]]\n8:null\nd:[[\"$\",\"title\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"Cube LED Display P3 - Dynamic 3D LED Solution Dubai | Brightluxx\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"description\",\"content\":\"Shop Cube LED Display P3 in Dubai for dynamic 3D advertising. Brightluxx offers top LED products across UAE. Buy now!\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"2\",{\"rel\":\"canonical\",\"href\":\"https://brightluxx.com/products/cube-led-display-p3\"}]]\n","/$c$slug/__PAGE__":"1:\"$Sreact.fragment\"\n2:T641,{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"Product\", \"name\": \"Cube LED Display P3\", \"description\": \"The Cube LED Display P